<title>UK: Vodohospodarska sets $200 mln 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Vodohospodarska sets $200 mln 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VODOHOSPODARSKA VYSTAVBA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SLOVAK REPUBLIC</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    19.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+115 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB-	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SLOVAKIA  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.OCT.06 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
